# Cloudflare Pages security headers.
#
# NOTE ON THE CSP BELOW. It differs deliberately from a "textbook" policy:
#
#   * script-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' because ALL of this site's JavaScript is
#     in one inline <script> block, and there are inline handlers too (the font
#     preload's onload, and onerror on the placeholder <img> tags). Dropping
#     'unsafe-inline' would break the whole page. To remove it properly, move
#     the JS to an external file and replace the inline handlers first.
#   * style-src / font-src allow Google Fonts, which the page loads from
#     fonts.googleapis.com and fonts.gstatic.com. A policy of
#     "style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'" alone would block the stylesheet and
#     the page would render in fallback fonts.
#   * challenges.cloudflare.com is pre-allowed so enabling Turnstile later does
#     not require a header change.
#   * form-action is 'self' because the form currently has no endpoint. When a
#     hosted provider is wired in, add its origin here or submissions will be
#     blocked.
#
# Verify with https://securityheaders.com after deploying.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; form-action 'self'
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
